(6288034, 930788, 124346, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, you have a good chance to win.  I''m trying to analyze it, I assume you used a low ISO because it looks really sharp and noiseless, also a high F number to get the light in the back look like that and if so, you should''ve used a semi-long shutter speed to get the correct exposure, but there must''ve not been any wind because the trees look so still.  Or maybe you used a star filter.  Nice composition and colors, very harmonic.</td>', 'Beautiful picture, you have a good chance to win.  I''m trying to analyze it, I assume you used a low ISO because it looks really sharp and noiseless, also a high F number to get the light in the back look like that and if so, you should''ve used a semi-long shutter speed to get the correct exposure, but there must''ve not been any wind because the trees look so still.  Or maybe you used a star filter.  Nice composition and colors, very harmonic.', '2011-01-19 09:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
