(6289267, 930431, 16148, '<td valign="top">I''m usually not a fan of this style but you caught my attention for some reason.  I feel a disturbance in the night or early morning.  The grain adds to this effect.  I''m interested to see how this is received.</td>', 'I''m usually not a fan of this style but you caught my attention for some reason.  I feel a disturbance in the night or early morning.  The grain adds to this effect.  I''m interested to see how this is received.', '2011-01-20 11:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
