(6289274, 930464, 16148, '<td valign="top">The glass pitcher containing clear light bulbs is appealing and the dark lamp shade completes you story.  Good luck!</td>', 'The glass pitcher containing clear light bulbs is appealing and the dark lamp shade completes you story.  Good luck!', '2011-01-20 11:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
