(6290344, 930464, 10785, '<td valign="top">I recognize this pitcher! Nice work on the lighting and setup! The photo is a little unbalanced in it''s composition to me. The tall light and the short pitcher are somewhat mismatched. I would also like to see more at the bottom. The photo is unbalanced in it''s placement in the frame as well. Too far to the bottom in m opinion. However the tones are great with quite a range of blacks to whites and the lighting is wonderful with great shadows to highlights but no blowouts or loss of detail due to being too dark.</td>', 'I recognize this pitcher! Nice work on the lighting and setup! The photo is a little unbalanced in it''s composition to me. The tall light and the short pitcher are somewhat mismatched. I would also like to see more at the bottom. The photo is unbalanced in it''s placement in the frame as well. Too far to the bottom in m opinion. However the tones are great with quite a range of blacks to whites and the lighting is wonderful with great shadows to highlights but no blowouts or loss of detail due to being too dark.', '2011-01-21 20:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6290345, 930680, 10785, '<td valign="top">Neat shot and good use of depth of field. I don''t know if you did it intentionally or just missed it but the seam of the lampshade in the foreground could have been turned and hidden for a leaner effect in my opinion.</td>', 'Neat shot and good use of depth of field. I don''t know if you did it intentionally or just missed it but the seam of the lampshade in the foreground could have been turned and hidden for a leaner effect in my opinion.', '2011-01-21 20:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6290349, 930259, 10785, '<td valign="top">zooming in a little further would have made for a much better detail shot! I do love the color in the photo and the nice warm glow!</td>', 'zooming in a little further would have made for a much better detail shot! I do love the color in the photo and the nice warm glow!', '2011-01-21 20:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
