(6291220, 930497, 117534, '<td valign="top">I Really like this, although the lamp light is very bright, in my opinion I feel it sets well with the mood and spookyness of this scene. The soft focus also is very effective here. Your compostion works really well, as I am drawn to the gates and then my eyes wander off to the graves and the background to the right. And oh my gosh is that really Spanish Moss hanging on those trees? I sit here and keep looking at this and I want to pull my collar high over my neck to keep from getting bit by a vampire! My first run thru I gave this an 8 but after comming back to comment and really studying this piece, I think it well deserves a 9.. Good Luck Can''t wait to see where this was taken</td>', 'I Really like this, although the lamp light is very bright, in my opinion I feel it sets well with the mood and spookyness of this scene. The soft focus also is very effective here. Your compostion works really well, as I am drawn to the gates and then my eyes wander off to the graves and the background to the right. And oh my gosh is that really Spanish Moss hanging on those trees? I sit here and keep looking at this and I want to pull my collar high over my neck to keep from getting bit by a vampire! My first run thru I gave this an 8 but after comming back to comment and really studying this piece, I think it well deserves a 9.. Good Luck Can''t wait to see where this was taken', '2011-01-23 01:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
