(6291764, 930693, 86447, '<td valign="top">If this weren''t a lamp challenge, this would not make sense to me... As it is, I find myself wanting the subject to be the roses, because they''re pretty and the red catches my eye... but that huge round thing overwhelms them.<br/> <br/>I think that challenge entries have to stand on their own without the challenge... and if someone asked me what this was, I''d say it''s roses... on a weird round thing.<br/> <br/>I''m not trying to be cruel... quite the opposite, in fact.  But, I can''t find any other way to explain my thoughts.     (not voting)</td>', 'If this weren''t a lamp challenge, this would not make sense to me... As it is, I find myself wanting the subject to be the roses, because they''re pretty and the red catches my eye... but that huge round thing overwhelms them. I think that challenge entries have to stand on their own without the challenge... and if someone asked me what this was, I''d say it''s roses... on a weird round thing. I''m not trying to be cruel... quite the opposite, in fact.  But, I can''t find any other way to explain my thoughts.     (not voting)', '2011-01-23 17:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6291769, 930259, 86447, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful lamp!  And beautifully photographed!   The thing that bothers me, though, is the light spot on the left... the light on the wall.    It detracts me from the lamp... I know it''s Basic Editing and you can''t edit it, so I wish you had cropped it out, or moved the lamp a bit more into the frame.  You did really well controlling the light... it''s beautiful.    (not voting)</td>', 'What a beautiful lamp!  And beautifully photographed!   The thing that bothers me, though, is the light spot on the left... the light on the wall.    It detracts me from the lamp... I know it''s Basic Editing and you can''t edit it, so I wish you had cropped it out, or moved the lamp a bit more into the frame.  You did really well controlling the light... it''s beautiful.    (not voting)', '2011-01-23 17:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6291774, 930303, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good find, clever framing.</td>', 'Good find, clever framing.', '2011-01-23 17:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6291775, 929942, 76335, '<td valign="top">What a mood. The lamp does nothing to cut through the gloomy, bleak atmosphere. It shines anyway. Superb.</td>', 'What a mood. The lamp does nothing to cut through the gloomy, bleak atmosphere. It shines anyway. Superb.', '2011-01-23 17:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6291924, 929893, 126077, '<td valign="top">Creative interpretation of the challenge. I enjoy that the typical proportions of the lamp and the bulb have been reversed. The colors are nice, but the image comes across as bland. The soft diffuse lighting and white limbo don''t give much for the eyes to chew on. The shadow is nice, however I find the reflections in the glass of the bulb to be rather dull.</td>', 'Creative interpretation of the challenge. I enjoy that the typical proportions of the lamp and the bulb have been reversed. The colors are nice, but the image comes across as bland. The soft diffuse lighting and white limbo don''t give much for the eyes to chew on. The shadow is nice, however I find the reflections in the glass of the bulb to be rather dull.', '2011-01-23 20:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6291925, 930323, 126077, '<td valign="top">The mood in this image is nice. The color of the light and the slightly diffuse web-like shadow on the wall really mellow me out.</td>', 'The mood in this image is nice. The color of the light and the slightly diffuse web-like shadow on the wall really mellow me out.', '2011-01-23 20:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6291928, 930555, 126077, '<td valign="top">The angle and colors are great.I feel close to the man in this image. Saturated colors and sharp focus on the hands give the man presence. He is the builder of flames.  The keeper of the flame of hope. A noble thing for sure. <br/> <br/>The green mass of what I presume is torso/arm and leg on the left side of the image is distracting. With so much area OOF, the hands are visually smaller. Cropping the image or composing it originally to make the hands larger on the sensor would give them more strength.</td>', 'The angle and colors are great.I feel close to the man in this image. Saturated colors and sharp focus on the hands give the man presence. He is the builder of flames.  The keeper of the flame of hope. A noble thing for sure.  The green mass of what I presume is torso/arm and leg on the left side of the image is distracting. With so much area OOF, the hands are visually smaller. Cropping the image or composing it originally to make the hands larger on the sensor would give them more strength.', '2011-01-23 20:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6291929, 930689, 126077, '<td valign="top">I love the crispness of this image. Contrast in the snow and lamp is superb. Very clear atmosphere give great colors. The angle is good, the OOF text in upper camera left does not grab the eyes attention over the lamp. Eye movement for me at least goes from lamp to text and then around. The GE logo in the center of the lamp is especially crisp. Great capture and PW. <br/> <br/>Of the many images of lamps in the challenge, most of them show the lamps that are turned on. This image shows an unlit lamp but still has the clarity and crispness of an image of a light source. The brightness of the center of the lamp contrast with the darkness of the brown metal background in the same way a lamp outshines its setting. <br/> <br/>Sick photo man.</td>', 'I love the crispness of this image. Contrast in the snow and lamp is superb. Very clear atmosphere give great colors. The angle is good, the OOF text in upper camera left does not grab the eyes attention over the lamp. Eye movement for me at least goes from lamp to text and then around. The GE logo in the center of the lamp is especially crisp. Great capture and PW.  Of the many images of lamps in the challenge, most of them show the lamps that are turned on. This image shows an unlit lamp but still has the clarity and crispness of an image of a light source. The brightness of the center of the lamp contrast with the darkness of the brown metal background in the same way a lamp outshines its setting.  Sick photo man.', '2011-01-23 21:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6291933, 930810, 126077, '<td valign="top">Nice PW. The colors are visually interesting. They don''t have much life, and the technology and the processing confuse me, but its pretty. The fish bowl is rockin back there. The extended lens on the canon in front is creepy.</td>', 'Nice PW. The colors are visually interesting. They don''t have much life, and the technology and the processing confuse me, but its pretty. The fish bowl is rockin back there. The extended lens on the canon in front is creepy.', '2011-01-23 21:10:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6291936, 930687, 126077, '<td valign="top">Cool colors. Weird low contrast on the edges of the vignette. May be only my monitor. I like the night light. Very unique. Because I have never seen one like it before, to me, the image would be more interesting without the girl and only the light. Just have open wall space there. Maybe recompose a bit to tighten the framing. IMO, that would''ve made a nicer image.</td>', 'Cool colors. Weird low contrast on the edges of the vignette. May be only my monitor. I like the night light. Very unique. Because I have never seen one like it before, to me, the image would be more interesting without the girl and only the light. Just have open wall space there. Maybe recompose a bit to tighten the framing. IMO, that would''ve made a nicer image.', '2011-01-23 21:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6291938, 930297, 126077, '<td valign="top">Cool coil. The hot white speculars on it make it look like its made from glass. The bokeh is bumpin''. Lovely little pearly spheres. Cool image, would''ve liked some more contrast and maybe a tad bit of brightness on the glass. Keep the background low and the heat up the foreground. Keep the heated coil and lead wires dark and saturated. Maybe a slight vignette on the background''s brightness. Offset, so the coil really "glows". Very subtle modifications.</td>', 'Cool coil. The hot white speculars on it make it look like its made from glass. The bokeh is bumpin''. Lovely little pearly spheres. Cool image, would''ve liked some more contrast and maybe a tad bit of brightness on the glass. Keep the background low and the heat up the foreground. Keep the heated coil and lead wires dark and saturated. Maybe a slight vignette on the background''s brightness. Offset, so the coil really "glows". Very subtle modifications.', '2011-01-23 21:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6292010, 930146, 92994, '<td valign="top">Nice idea!  Usually, I don''t like to hear small comments like that.  Who cares about the technical details all the time?  Mostly, it''s the idea behind the capture.  In this case, it''s great, and an idea most are familiar with.  Technically, the composition is in order, with the lighting emphasizing the intriguing parts of the photo.  I like the smoke, outfit, and facial expression...nice idea  :o)</td>', 'Nice idea!  Usually, I don''t like to hear small comments like that.  Who cares about the technical details all the time?  Mostly, it''s the idea behind the capture.  In this case, it''s great, and an idea most are familiar with.  Technically, the composition is in order, with the lighting emphasizing the intriguing parts of the photo.  I like the smoke, outfit, and facial expression...nice idea  :o)', '2011-01-23 23:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6292012, 930788, 92994, '<td valign="top">Great idea and composition.  I like the color of the sky, and the "oncoming train".</td>', 'Great idea and composition.  I like the color of the sky, and the "oncoming train".', '2011-01-23 23:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6292013, 929893, 92994, '<td valign="top">It makes me think; I like it.</td>', 'It makes me think; I like it.', '2011-01-23 23:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6292015, 930743, 92994, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if the elements in this photograph would have been more effective placed off-center...however, I like the way the moon looks, and the color composition with the lamps, deep blue sky, and moon.  Great idea.</td>', 'I''m not sure if the elements in this photograph would have been more effective placed off-center...however, I like the way the moon looks, and the color composition with the lamps, deep blue sky, and moon.  Great idea.', '2011-01-23 23:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6292016, 930502, 92994, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  What''s up with the filaments?  haha<br/>I like how the smoothness of the bulb is emphasized in here...and the weird filaments too.</td>', 'Nice capture.  What''s up with the filaments?  hahaI like how the smoothness of the bulb is emphasized in here...and the weird filaments too.', '2011-01-23 23:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6292020, 930804, 92994, '<td valign="top">The lower lights in the background remind me of the lights you see on the floor at the edge of a stage.  Good placement of the lamp.  Good color composition with the lamp as well as the background.  Title is very fitting.</td>', 'The lower lights in the background remind me of the lights you see on the floor at the edge of a stage.  Good placement of the lamp.  Good color composition with the lamp as well as the background.  Title is very fitting.', '2011-01-23 23:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6292024, 930736, 92994, '<td valign="top">Striking composition.  It''s bold, and gives me the willies...something about the copper rings.  I think the texture is freaky.  I actually forget the bright light is there.</td>', 'Striking composition.  It''s bold, and gives me the willies...something about the copper rings.  I think the texture is freaky.  I actually forget the bright light is there.', '2011-01-23 23:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6292026, 930513, 92994, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Effective use of DOF, and perfect background to complement.</td>', 'Very nice.  Effective use of DOF, and perfect background to complement.', '2011-01-23 23:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6292034, 930053, 92994, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract, and good use of DOF.  I''m not sure if the color''s too distracting.  Have you tried black and white?</td>', 'Nice abstract, and good use of DOF.  I''m not sure if the color''s too distracting.  Have you tried black and white?', '2011-01-23 23:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6292040, 930501, 92994, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  At first glance, I didn''t think much of it.  I think I didn''t pay close attention, but then when I read the title, and noticed the shadow, everything fell in place!</td>', 'Great idea!  At first glance, I didn''t think much of it.  I think I didn''t pay close attention, but then when I read the title, and noticed the shadow, everything fell in place!', '2011-01-23 23:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
