(6292042, 930725, 92994, '<td valign="top">Very lonely feel to this.  I like the environment, and the solitude of the subjects.  Great color composition as well.</td>', 'Very lonely feel to this.  I like the environment, and the solitude of the subjects.  Great color composition as well.', '2011-01-23 23:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
