(6295693, 930323, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like how this is cropped, so that the softer part of the image has more room but the lamp itself has more intensity. Equalizes things even though it is off-center. My only suggestion would be that a smooth wall or background would have given the shadows more impact. I find the wall''s texture distracting. Lovely image!</td>', 'I like how this is cropped, so that the softer part of the image has more room but the lamp itself has more intensity. Equalizes things even though it is off-center. My only suggestion would be that a smooth wall or background would have given the shadows more impact. I find the wall''s texture distracting. Lovely image!', '2011-01-27 11:53:16.000000', NULL, 0),
